PS2-G08-2: with the deterministic option set, results still differ between 1 thread and >= 2 threads because
kgraphMapRbPart() (src/libscotch/kgraph_map_rb_part.c:316) splits the context into two sub-contexts, the second one
with its own pseudo-random stream (common_context.c:280-299), without consulting CONTEXTOPTIONNUMDETERMINISTIC.
Observed with the full series applied (../SEP-13/strat, /tmp/claude-1000/-home-dev-workspace-pyscotch/087f3d41-a5d8-4b0a-9260-769d70cf8179/scratchpad/work/G08-bgraph-gg-gain/build):
