   same with 2 parts (one bisection job, no split):      thr1=7a18bd8b thr2=7a18bd8b
   default strategy: bump.grf and m16x16.grf agree across 1/2/4 threads; m4x4.grf, bump_b100000.grf and
   m16x16_b100000_v.grf differ between 1 and >= 2 threads (2, 4 and 8 always agree with each other).
